    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The salt ship sails off slowly. On the deck, all is quiet, as the crew watches the people they know gradually became smaller.\nA few rush up to the edge, as though they had changed their minds and wanted to jump across to the other ship, but are forced to stop as the distance between them grows.\nThey each watch the other go further and further away."
    },
